"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-27T03:03:50Z","updated_at":"2025-09-05T10:59:31Z","closed_at":"2025-09-05T10:59:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:  v4.5.beta6.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta6.mono - Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT (RADV NAVI32) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 30.46 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using a custom resource, `@export` variables do not update in the remote view window when changed by script. Even after adding `@tool` to the resource, the value of `updateInt` does not change in the remote view window when running the scene.\n\n\nCustom Resource:\n\n```gdscript \n@tool\nextends Resource\nclass_name NewResource\n\n@export var updateInt: int = 0`\n```\nResource referenced and changed by another script:\n\n```gdscript \nextends Node2D\n\n@export var resource: NewResource\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tresource.updateInt = 99\n\tprint(\"Curent Value: \" + `str(resource.updateInt))\n``` \n\nOutput to console is `Curent Value:  99`  but the resource in the remote view still displays 0. This is not just a graphical glitch either. When I increase `updateInt` by one in the remote view using the arrows, the value does not jump to 100, it only goes to 1.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Run scene in MRP\n- Open remote view for Node2D\n- Open `NewResource` in Node2D\n- Value displayed for `updateInt` will be different from value reported in console \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_ExportBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22000252/MRP_ExportBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110001/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110001/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}